"x:Squats":["Hold the kettlebell close to your chest by the horns.","Set your feet shoulder width apart with toes slightly out.","Squat down with your chest up and elbows inside your knees.","Drive back up through the whole foot."],
"x:Air Squat":["Stand with your feet shoulder width apart and toes slightly out.","Reach your arms forward and push your hips back.","Squat down until your thighs are at least parallel, keeping your chest up.","Drive back up through the whole foot."],
"x:Snatch":["Hike the kettlebell back between your legs.","Snap your hips forward and pull the bell upward close to your body.","Punch your hand through as the bell flips over to lock out overhead.","Let it drop back in an arc into the next swing."],
"x:Leg Raise":["Lie on your back with your legs straight and hands by your sides.","Press your lower back into the floor.","Raise your legs until they point straight up.","Lower them slowly without letting your lower back arch."],
"x:Full Crunch":["Lie on your back with knees bent and hands by your temples.","Curl your shoulders off the floor while pulling your knees toward your chest.","Squeeze your abs at the top.","Lower slowly back to the start."],
"x:Bicycle":["Lie on your back with your hands behind your head and legs raised.","Bring one knee toward your chest while rotating the opposite elbow toward it.","Extend that leg and switch sides in a pedaling motion.","Keep your lower back pressed to the floor."],
"x:V Sits":["Lie on your back with arms overhead and legs straight.","Lift your legs and torso at the same time to form a V.","Reach your hands toward your toes.","Lower back down under control."],
"x:Hollow hold":["Lie on your back with arms overhead and legs straight.","Press your lower back into the floor.","Lift your arms, shoulders and legs a few centimeters off the floor.","Hold the position with your core tight."],
"x:High Plank":["Place your hands under your shoulders with arms straight.","Extend your legs behind you so your body forms a straight line.","Brace your core and squeeze your glutes.","Hold the position without letting your hips sag."],
"x:Plank":["Place your forearms on the floor with elbows under your shoulders.","Extend your legs behind you so your body forms a straight line.","Brace your core and squeeze your glutes.","Hold the position without letting your hips sag."],
"x:Russian Twist":["Sit with your knees bent and lean back slightly with a straight back.","Lift your feet off the floor if you can.","Rotate your torso from side to side, touching the floor or weight beside each hip.","Keep the movement controlled from your core."],
"x:Seated Deadbug":["Sit on the floor and lean back onto your hands or forearms.","Lift your feet with knees bent.","Extend one leg straight out while keeping the other bent.","Switch legs in a slow, controlled pattern."],
"x:Bicep Curl":["Stand with a kettlebell or dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.","Pin your elbows to your sides.","Curl the weight up toward your shoulders without swinging.","Lower slowly to straight arms."],
"x:Tricep Extension":["Hold a kettlebell or dumbbell overhead with both hands.","Keep your elbows pointing forward and close to your head.","Lower the weight behind your head by bending at the elbows.","Extend your arms back to straight."],
"x:Deadlift – Row":["Stand with the kettlebells or dumbbells in front of your feet.","Deadlift them up to standing with a flat back.","Hinge forward and row the weights to your hips.","Lower and set the weights down before the next rep."]
